WEBVTT

00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.880
The opening battle of the Union Fest

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:07.200
was the one-on-one between Ecle and myself.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.500
Right now Biscotti has the lead in points.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.640
Up next are Biscotti and Pastillage:

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.450
it'll be the Princess versus Becky!

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.160
I'm going out to get some battle points.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:16.910
Nanami, I'm counting on you, too!

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:18.490
Okay. I'll do my best.

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:58.430
One-On-One In The Skies and On Land

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:58.430
Harlan and Pickle are 
ready for take off!

00:01:58.710 --> 00:02:01.430
Front and rear safety check complete!

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:03.900
Chief, Princess, we're ready.

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:04.520
Yes!

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:07.520
Ruler of Biscotti, Millihiore, and...

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:10.020
Chief of the Royal Research 
Institute, Ricotta...

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.150
are moving out!

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:23.390
Indeed!

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:24.950
Bring it on Millihi-nee, Rico!

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.540
We'll fight this one out in the skies!

00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:34.000
Biscotti's and Pastillage's 
representatives will clash in the sky!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:40.070
General, thank you for escorting me.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:41.220
Don't mention it!

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:44.890
Hero and general, this 
is an unusual combination!

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:55.730
Biscotti's 3rd Battalion

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.820
The size of their army...

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:04.130
I see, they want to completely

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:06.300
crush our 3rd Battalion here.

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:08.910
My assault team and I will take on

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.170
the small fry from your 3rd Battalion.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:14.920
And d'Arquien, you'll 
be facing our Hero!

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:21.180
Hina-sama! May I fight you one-on-one?

00:03:22.110 --> 00:03:24.860
If you're specifically asking for it,

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:26.310
how could I refuse?

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:30.560
Biscotti's 3rd Battalion and myself

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:35.110
accept your challenge!

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:47.330
Don't hesitate! Charge!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:03.870
All right, our 1st camp's pushing forward.

00:04:03.870 --> 00:04:05.720
General, your orders?

00:04:06.450 --> 00:04:08.790
Yes, to the main Galette force:

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:13.230
Attack and crush 
Pastillage's front lines!

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:18.150
All units! Advance!

00:04:19.970 --> 00:04:23.880
Galette's entire main 
force is advancing.

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:26.240
They look ready to annihilate.

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:29.620
Jaune, you take command here.

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:31.250
Yes, sir.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.870
Vert, you come with me.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:37.630
We're going to take down 
Pastillage's Sky Knights.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:38.970
Roger that!

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:58.610
Congratulation for 
clearing this section.

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:00.730
Here's your award ribbon.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:04.180
Those soldiers who make it 
through an obstacle course,

00:05:04.180 --> 00:05:06.500
conquer a defensive position,

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:09.780
or who defeat multiple opposing soldiers

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.540
will naturally get their normal bounty,

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:15.080
but this time they'll also 
get a special prize

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.740
from each land's support organizations.

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:22.660
Wonderful prizes have been gathered 
from all three countries!

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:25.510
Food items, the latest household wares,

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.510
event and travel vouchers 
are just a small selection!

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:30.760
So our soldiers,

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:33.730
please do your best to win them all!

00:05:35.670 --> 00:05:37.270
Now, let us take a quick look

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.770
at the situation in town.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:42.120
Are people getting excited in the 
town beneath Firianno Castle?

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:44.670
That's quite involved.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:45.860
Of course.

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.040
These kinds of large scale

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:51.780
mega events are broadcast everywhere.

00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:54.240
The knights, Heroes, and rulers

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:56.330
are all loved by the common folk.

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:59.570
Well, I guess it's good that the humans

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:00.830
are living in peace.

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:03.040
That way, both the Demon King

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.520
and the Hero King can slack off

00:06:04.520 --> 00:06:05.920
without having to worry about anything.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:09.680
But it looks like this Hero 
King can't really handle it...

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:13.970
They don't look like they can control themselves.

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:19.430
Adel.

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:21.980
Why don't you just go and join the fun?

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:24.490
It's not like that!

00:06:24.960 --> 00:06:28.740
I just wanted to see what 
war's like these days!

00:06:29.000 --> 00:06:32.010
Besides, it wouldn't be good if old folk

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:34.740
interrupt the young people's festival.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.890
Princess!

00:06:44.890 --> 00:06:47.510
We were able to make 
it, just as promised!

00:06:47.900 --> 00:06:51.260
Rebecca-san! Thank you!

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.010
I'm really happy!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.560
No, I have to thank you!

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.610
Usually those two are best friends,

00:06:57.610 --> 00:06:59.600
but today they're enemies!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:02.810
But still, they're 
going into it smiling!

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:04.060
Even if we're friends,

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.190
we won't be holding back in this fight!

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:10.820
Let's show them the Biscotti 
aerial fighting style!

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.250
Sounds interesting.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.690
Rebecca, let's open fire!

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:15.490
Yeah!

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:17.330
Palette card, ready!

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:19.580
Flow Light Barrage!

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.340
Fire!

00:07:26.590 --> 00:07:27.590
Explode!

00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:34.630
That's our bullet rain 
that pierces the skies!

00:07:34.630 --> 00:07:36.100
Can you dodge that?!

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:37.930
Let's return fire.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:39.180
Roger that!

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:43.400
Deploying counter-fire... barrage!

00:07:49.060 --> 00:07:50.680
And... go!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:05.360
So pretty...

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:06.540
Indeed.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:09.520
This was an wonderful opening 
exchange of attack and defense!

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:12.430
Princess, Chief, what were 
those moves just now?!

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:15.260
Special bullets from the Royal 
Research Institute and...

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:18.720
My emblem sword that 
I practiced for today!

00:08:19.340 --> 00:08:22.210
Both the Princess and Rico are amazing.

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:23.120
Yeah.

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.590
Rico and the Princess have

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:26.730
been working very hard this whole time.

00:08:27.360 --> 00:08:28.260
<i>One...</i>

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.230
<i>For Biscotti's victory...</i>

00:08:30.850 --> 00:08:33.600
<i>for a war that's even more fun.</i>

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.530
Then we have all the more 
reason that we have to win.

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.260
Yeah!

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:42.000
Move forward!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.500
Don't fret! Charge!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:54.260
I see. I can tell you were Sink's teacher.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.010
We've been working hard 
together since we were little.

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:00.990
Even if my opponent is you, 
the strongest in the land,

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.810
aiming to win is Galette's style!

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:05.190
I will go all out!

00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:07.240
I look forward to it.

00:09:08.170 --> 00:09:11.390
Here I... go!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:22.280
Tempest Slash!

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:35.550
Ex Machina, Form Change!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.010
Boomerang Slash!

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.510
Neptune Fist!

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.500
Bright Power Charge!

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.200
Freeze!

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:22.250
Link active!

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.890
Here I go!

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:33.530
This is...

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.560
Finishing blow!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.390
Lupine God Void Fang

00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.030
Demon Sealing Judgement!

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:35.950
That was close...

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.530
Oh, no...

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:51.650
Wow! Lady d'Arquien's 
armor was destroyed!

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:57.530
Hero Nanami's boomerang flew 
down from above and hit!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.460
Even though Hero Nanami went down,

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:01.770
this was excellent!

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:06.050
Galette Spirit...

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:17.100
Biscotti's strong in both one-on-ones 
and in the group battles.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.900
We're going to ride this 
high and push through!

00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.220
High's don't matter!

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:23.900
Fighting with skill and 
power is Galette's style!

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.780
I'm going all out!

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:30.240
Transform!

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.820
T-Transform?!

00:13:37.820 --> 00:13:40.770
Who are those hotties?

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:44.480
The details are secret,
 but this is their special move!

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:46.470
Apparently this is a 
hypercharged mode where

00:13:46.470 --> 00:13:48.230
all their powers gain in potency!

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:50.100
Is that okay?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.060
Using that in public?

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:55.610
Yes, I actually recommended it.

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:58.690
That's another proper way that will lead

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.420
to giving people hope and joy.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:03.010
That's fine, but you need to calm down.

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:12.470
Furious Lightning Strike!

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:37.040
You're annoying, Rico!

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:38.930
You bet I am!

00:14:38.930 --> 00:14:41.650
Ecle really gave her best today!

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:45.050
I have to show the princess 
and the Heroes that

00:14:45.050 --> 00:14:47.480
I am capable as well!

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:52.620
The same goes for me!

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:59.520
Pastillage's people are watching!

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.570
I cannot lose this fight!

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:12.470
Harlan, here we go!

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:01.670
Both of them are incredible...

00:16:01.670 --> 00:16:02.690
Yeah...

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.530
<i>Truth be told, I was a bit nervous</i>

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:07.940
<i>about this vacation.</i>

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:11.780
<i>Sink had told me that he 
really loved this place,</i>

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:13.950
<i>where he made tons of new friends...</i>

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:19.450
<i>I was afraid that there'd 
be no place for me there.</i>

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:22.160
<i>That'd never happen!</i>

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.630
<i>You're an important guest!</i>

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:28.830
<i>Yes, I was truly welcomed 
from the first day,</i>

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:31.630
<i>and Cou-sama even made me a Hero.</i>

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:34.240
<i>I was able to become 
friends with such a</i>

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:35.920
<i>nice and cute Princess as you.</i>

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:39.010
<i>I'm glad I was able to come here.</i>

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.890
<i>I'm really glad I was able to</i>

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:42.330
<i>become friends with you!</i>

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:45.900
<i>I feel the same way, Rebecca!</i>

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.660
<i>Wouldn't it be really 
fun if the two of us</i>

00:16:47.660 --> 00:16:50.170
<i>could have a fight 
during tomorrow's war?</i>

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:52.410
<i>Hero versus Princess.</i>

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:54.320
<i>Yes, certainly!</i>

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.570
<i>Cheering on and watching over</i>

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.080
<i>someone you love is fun...</i>

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:01.580
<i>but being able to compete 
with them is even better!</i>

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.960
<i>Because you're somone I love,</i>

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.370
<i>I want you to see...</i>

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:08.340
<i>my passion and my unrelenting courage!</i>

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.360
Here I go, Princess!

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.970
Witch Cannon - Asterism Strive!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.940
Right, Rebecca!

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:16.460
Excelide!

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:32.480
The Princess's and Rebecca-sama's biggest

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:33.940
attacks just clashed!

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:36.200
Both were finishing moves!

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.700
Who was victorious?

00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.170
Princess!

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:49.710
I'm coming right away!

00:17:53.290 --> 00:17:56.050
What? Seriously?!

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:00.760
Princess, Princess, wake up!

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:03.840
Huh?

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:05.920
We're falling! It's bad!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:11.370
Oh no! We have to save them!

00:18:11.370 --> 00:18:12.500
Yes, indeed!

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.170
That was a good fight,

00:18:18.170 --> 00:18:19.820
but you have to stay safe.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:23.400
It'd be really bad if 
either of you got hurt.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:25.360
Sink...

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:28.830
Hero Sink has gracefully 
saved them in midair!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:31.150
It appears that he went to save them

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:33.410
right after he defeated Prince Gaul!

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:34.740
I didn't lose!

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:36.340
I let him have this one!

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:39.620
Umm... Thank you, Sink.

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:41.460
Thank you very much!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:02.120
The Princess' and Hero Rebecca's 
armor was destroyed!

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:04.370
Now we did it...

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:06.620
I'm sorry!

00:19:09.640 --> 00:19:11.720
Looks like they need 
our rescue after all.

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:13.160
Yes, indeed.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:26.140
Hero Nanami's back!

00:19:30.140 --> 00:19:32.650
Biscotti's got the most victory points!

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.210
Can Galette catch up?

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:38.010
Shut up, we'll overtake them now!

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:39.450
Right!

00:19:39.870 --> 00:19:43.450
Will Pastillage, currently in 
last place, be all right?!

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:48.450
Pastillage Main Camp

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:54.090
The point gap keeps growing!

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:56.930
Will there really be a 
chance for an upset?!

00:19:56.930 --> 00:19:58.990
Your motherland's in danger.

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:01.220
Don't you have to go save them?

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:06.640
If you don't want to show 
your true identity, use this.

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:36.710
People of Pastillage!

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:38.090
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:45.330
For justice!

00:20:46.030 --> 00:20:47.760
For hope!

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:57.520
Here to aid Pastillage, I am Hero Mask!

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:03.110
Yup!

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:11.740
She's really into it.

00:21:11.740 --> 00:21:13.830
Adel-sama's wonderful.

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:23.060
If the Hero King, I mean...  If Hero Mask's our opponent...

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:25.420
The three youngsters from Biscotti...

00:21:25.420 --> 00:21:27.050
Will rise to the challenge!

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:31.830
Sounds good, bring it on!

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:37.100
Union Fest, the event that takes place

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.540
when the three countries are united.

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:43.600
The first day of the war 
was intense and fun....

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:46.330
but it was just still just beginning!

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:49.430
The festival fun will still go on!

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.890
If I got bigger with a Hero Crystal,

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:34.350
I bet I'd look like this.

00:23:34.350 --> 00:23:35.940
No way, you're already...

00:23:35.180 --> 00:25:00.000
<b>Change My Heart</b>

00:23:35.940 --> 00:23:37.380
Gaul! Shhh!

00:23:37.880 --> 00:23:39.460
See you next time.
